    "EventReport": [
      {
        "uuid": "34510b00-2189-571a-91a0-f6a625e45f97",
        "name": "09:25 watch assessment | Initial coverage",
        "content": "At 09:25 UTC all six sites have an unverified collection gap. A regional collection interruption is a plausible working explanation. Confidence is low. The dashboard and the help-desk ticket both draw on the central index. No destination journal or change record has reached the watch. Next update before the 10:00 handover.",
        "distribution": "5",
        "timestamp": "1791969900"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "8cca92f3-9465-58cb-879a-8ab701d81fb1",
        "name": "Receipt reconciliation | 09:50 UTC",
        "content": "One batch per site was due at 09:10 UTC on 14 October. Match each identifier to its site and date. Times come from GH-03.\n\n| Site | Batch | Created (UTC) | Indexed (UTC) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Alder | @[attribute](1b9e7137-fa0a-51d8-8394-660746d18977) | 09:07 | 09:36 |\n| Birch | @[attribute](686a1224-6d18-510c-a266-ed4ab92a650e) | 09:07 | 09:37 |\n| Cedar | @[attribute](af45a058-eddd-595c-802a-3fe6e57794cf) | 09:08 | 09:38 |\n| Elm | @[attribute](0e0cc153-6cd3-5315-918b-ee5f8a36f8b4) | 09:08 | 09:40 |\n| Pine | @[attribute](099a38d2-bafe-581b-acf5-4401970314cb) | 09:09 | 09:41 |\n| Fen | Unverified | Unknown | No receipt by 09:50 |\n\nFive of six batches can be traced to a destination receipt. The Fen cell is open pending a local sequence and the 11:30 retry.",
        "distribution": "5",
        "timestamp": "1791971400"
      },
      {
        "uuid": "4bdaac58-f1db-5fbf-8877-f85301c804cf",
        "name": "Greyhaven archive | 10:00 duty briefing",
        "content": "Five of six sites collected on time. Their receipts appeared late. Fen remains unverified. The continuity lead needs the coverage count for the 10:00 UTC handover on 14 October. Information cutoff 09:50 UTC.\n\nCurrent coverage. @[object](78525216-886e-5324-8a4a-db45516a56fc) At 09:24 the index showed zero receipts @[object](afaa66c2-ea99-5dfb-bb71-d669a507b0cc). A change ledger scheduled a queue hold @[object](62e31593-5860-574b-8d16-733459a27293). By 09:42 the destination journal contained five matching batches created before 09:10 @[object](8eeb4b38-3886-5ace-bba8-0edcb7c36102). This changes the 09:25 working explanation of a regional collection interruption.\n\nOutlook through noon. @[object](b9280e1a-3484-510c-8c0e-76f0543ed474) Fen reported a completion marker @[object](153e98b6-6f54-57a4-8375-50dfd63ff878) and a clock warning @[attribute](7f28b4a1-314f-552a-8dac-b3472861b539). The watch cannot verify which run produced the marker. A coverage statement for all six sites would depend on that unresolved observation.\n\nFollow-up. At 12:00 UTC the reconciliation analyst will match Fen's site, date and sequence against the destination journal. Record on-time recovery, late recovery, confirmed local loss or still unknown in a dated follow-up. Keep this forecast for comparison.",
        "distribution": "5",
        "timestamp": "1791971580",
        "Note": [
          {
            "uuid": "a7e95aea-768c-553a-ae06-6e5bfc61c45d",
            "object_uuid": "4bdaac58-f1db-5fbf-8877-f85301c804cf",
            "object_type": "EventReport",
            "distribution": "0",
            "created": "2026-10-14 09:53:00",
            "modified": "2026-10-14 09:53:00",
            "authors": "Duty editor (exercise)",
            "language": "en",
            "note": "Cutoff is 09:50 UTC. The continuity lead asked whether the region lost data. The watch counted matched packets, kept Fen open and retained the reviewer's lower estimate."
          }
        ],
